{"id":"en_the-affair-at-camp","title":"The Affair at CAMP","titleEn":"The Affair at CAMP","description":"Ritsu n’aurait jamais pensé que son mari se servirait d’un séjour de camping en famille pour dissimuler une liaison. C’est en repérant des dépenses suspectes sur le compte bancaire de celui-ci qu’elle commence à douter. Sans rien dire, elle le suit à la trace grâce au GPS et le retrouve au camping, où elle le surprend en compagnie d’une autre femme. Dès lors, une question demeure : comment Ritsu fera-t-elle payer l’homme qui a trahi sa confiance et brisé l’équilibre de leur famille ? Les péripéties de cette série peuvent être suivies sur Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-affair-at-camp/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-affair-at-camp/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Hate Love","Revenge & Satisfying","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diclc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-affair-at-camp_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diclc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-affair-at-camp_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diclc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-affair-at-camp_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diclc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-affair-at-camp_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diclc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","dow